  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Giving</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Giving aims to a) create an enabling environment for philanthropic giving using legal and tax frameworks to reward the corporate, community, and individual philanthropy of entities both present in the country and from the countrys diaspora; b) increase levels of philanthropic funding raised by local stakeholders from companies, communities, and individuals for development activities; c) support companies to develop corporate philanthropy strategies and operational plans to implement them; and d) catalyze the establishment of sustainable fund-raising platforms and tools that can easily be upscaled in times of emergencies, such as the COVID-19 pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
